    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d380">

                <pb facs="0639" n="625" sameAs="frus:frus1944v01/pg625"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">Lot 60–D 224, Box 4a: PIO 229</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Memorandum of Conversation, by Mr. Leo Pasvolsky,
                        Special; Assistant to the Secretary of State </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">[<placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>,] <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1944-02-19">February 19, 1944</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Mr. Wright called at my request. I handed him the attached Topical Outline and
                    said that we were handing a copy today to the Soviet Embassy.</p>
                <p>He inquired how soon they might expect actual memoranda and whether or not we
                    intend to transmit them one at a time as they are ready. I replied that I could
                    not tell him anything as to when we might be ready. I also said that it is not
                    our present intention to give them single documents.</p>
                <p>He inquired as to whether or not, in the event that no exchange of documents will
                    have taken place before the Under Secretary’s projected visit to London, Mr.
                    Stettinius will discuss the matter there.<anchor n="21" xml:id="d380-f1"/> I
                    replied that this question can be answered only at that time.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Leo Pasvolsky</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>


                <xi:include href="d380-a1.xml" xpointer="d380-a1"/>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d380-f1" n="21" xml:id="d380-f1-content">
                <p>See telegram 3071, April 14, midnight, from London, <ref target="#pg636">p.
